  "candidate": {
    "singleChange": "Add one optional private fixture option refreshAfterCorrection?: boolean to generic walkTo, default false. walkTo already owns snapshot(page), so no callback or target-aim change is needed. After correctMouseToRoute returns and before keydown, walkTo first rechecks the original deadline; when the option is true, it reads one snapshot, rechecks the deadline, assigns it to current, and returns only when still in budget and reachedRouteTarget is true. Otherwise it issues the original input only while still in budget.",
    "defaultBehavior": "All existing callers that omit or disable the option retain the exact current behavior and snapshot call count; Date.now remains unchanged.",
